  <h2>shelff on iPhone Duo</h2>

  <p>shelff is a PDF reader and library for iPad and iPhone, built for reading books as two-page spreads. Version 1.8 adds support for iPhone Duo. When the device is half open in book pose, a spread's gutter lands on the hinge, so a PDF reads like a printed book, and every interactive control keeps clear of the hinge region. The library grid aligns its columns with the hinge as well.</p>

  <p>The captures below were taken on the iPhone Duo simulator with iOS 27.1 beta. They will be replaced with photos of the actual device after launch. Version 1.8 is planned for release before the Duo ships on October 23.</p>

